  "description": "Coyote before commit d6e8fb9 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in Wiki\\CommentController::save that allows authenticated users to edit other users' wiki comments. Attackers can send POST requests to /Comment/Save/{wiki}/{id} with another user's comment id, bypassing the WikiCommentPolicy update check, so altered text appears under the original author's name.",
